            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mary M"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this vegan by using a chicken substitute and omitting the dairy products. Otherwise, I followed the recipe as written. It was absolutely delicious with enough spice to make me happy without being too spicy for the more tender mouths in my family. Will absolutely be making this again. I think adding some bell peppers of any color might be tasty, so I will likely try that at some point.",
